  "titles": {
    "_tiers_note": "Gothic clanhold, ascending, shown in English with Gothic co-titles beneath for dialogue. Built on thiudans (people-king) and reiks (ruler). Gardings (household-lord) barony; Markareiks (march-ruler) march; Kindins (district-governor) county; Drauhtins (war-band leader) duchy; Reiks (great ruler) principality; Thiudans (king) kingdom over a Thiudangardi; Mikilthiudans (great-king) empire. A clan culture rarely climbs past the middle tiers. (Rank titles are the real Gothic register, allowed.)",
    "display_policy": "Ruler/domain titles shown in setting-gen, domain lists and vassal trees are ENGLISH (or an approved commonly-known foreign term where set in 'ruler'). The *_native conlang forms are for NPC DIALOGUE ONLY, never for structural/UI displays.",
